WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.950
The first Drive Rush leads into the throw.

2
00:00:03.950 --> 00:00:04.700
A second Drive Rush reaches the later wake-up.

3
00:00:04.700 --> 00:00:05.900
The medium-overhead target chain meets the planted mine.

4
00:00:05.900 --> 00:00:07.950
Jumping medium punches continue the mine launch.

5
00:00:07.950 --> 00:00:10.050
Forward heavy punch and light Backfist complete the actual no-Super finish.
